    sj:acceptance "Sections with matching_version_tag_observed=false ([ggen_igniter] version 26.9.30 vs latest_published_release v26.8.27; [beam4pm] version 26.9.30 with no published-release pin; [wasm4pm] version 26.9.30 vs v26.9.30 published at a different SHA a7352d81 vs 80d429f1) each carry a typed UNKNOWN standing note in the next lock refresh, never an inferred CONFORMANT."^^xsd:string ;
